WEBVTT

00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,471
Hey everyone! Welcome to

00:00:02,471 --> 00:00:03,941
the SkilliZee Ideathon Portal.

00:00:03,941 --> 00:00:05,412
In this quick walkthrough,

00:00:05,412 --> 00:00:06,882
we'll show you exactly

00:00:06,882 --> 00:00:08,353
how to submit your

00:00:08,353 --> 00:00:09,824
project. It's super simple!

00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,305
First up, watch the

00:00:12,305 --> 00:00:13,611
briefing video carefully. It

00:00:13,611 --> 00:00:14,916
covers the full challenge

00:00:14,916 --> 00:00:16,222
details, what the judges

00:00:16,222 --> 00:00:17,527
are looking for, and

00:00:17,527 --> 00:00:18,833
how the submission process

00:00:18,833 --> 00:00:20,138
works. Once you've watched

00:00:20,138 --> 00:00:21,444
it, hit the Proceed

00:00:21,444 --> 00:00:22,749
to Rules button.

00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,785
Next, you'll see the

00:00:24,785 --> 00:00:26,070
Guidelines and Presentation slides.

00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:27,355
Go through them, they

00:00:27,355 --> 00:00:28,639
have all the instructions

00:00:28,639 --> 00:00:29,924
you need before preparing

00:00:29,924 --> 00:00:31,209
your final submission. When

00:00:31,209 --> 00:00:32,494
you're ready, click Start

00:00:32,494 --> 00:00:33,779
Portal to enter your

00:00:33,779 --> 00:00:35,064
team workspace.

00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,110
If this is your

00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,221
first time here, click

00:00:41,221 --> 00:00:42,331
Register Team. Fill in

00:00:42,331 --> 00:00:43,441
your team name, add

00:00:43,441 --> 00:00:44,552
all your team members,

00:00:44,552 --> 00:00:45,662
and set a four-digit

00:00:45,662 --> 00:00:46,772
PIN that your team

00:00:46,772 --> 00:00:47,883
will use to log

00:00:47,883 --> 00:00:48,993
in. Once everything looks

00:00:48,993 --> 00:00:50,103
good, hit Register and

00:00:50,103 --> 00:00:51,214
you're in!

00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,385
Already registered? No worries.

00:02:10,385 --> 00:02:11,771
Just select your team

00:02:11,771 --> 00:02:13,156
name from the dropdown,

00:02:13,156 --> 00:02:14,542
enter your four-digit PIN,

00:02:14,542 --> 00:02:15,927
and you'll unlock your

00:02:15,927 --> 00:02:17,313
workspace right away.

00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,407
Inside your workspace, you

00:02:27,407 --> 00:02:28,815
can upload your presentation

00:02:28,815 --> 00:02:30,222
file, paste your website

00:02:30,222 --> 00:02:31,630
or prototype link, and

00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:33,037
attach any other required

00:02:33,037 --> 00:02:34,445
documents. Take a moment

00:02:34,445 --> 00:02:35,852
to review everything carefully

00:02:35,852 --> 00:02:37,260
before you submit. And

00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:38,667
remember, only one team

00:02:38,667 --> 00:02:40,075
member needs to submit.

00:02:40,075 --> 00:02:41,482
Once it's submitted, the

00:02:41,482 --> 00:02:42,890
workspace locks for everyone

00:02:42,890 --> 00:02:44,297
on the team.

00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,310
Need to make changes

00:03:26,310 --> 00:03:27,619
after submitting? Don't worry,

00:03:27,619 --> 00:03:28,929
your mentor can unlock

00:03:28,929 --> 00:03:30,238
the workspace for you.

00:03:30,238 --> 00:03:31,548
And that's it! You're

00:03:31,548 --> 00:03:32,858
all set to complete

00:03:32,858 --> 00:03:34,167
your Ideathon submission. Best

00:03:34,167 --> 00:03:35,477
of luck to all

00:03:35,477 --> 00:03:36,786
the teams. Go build

00:03:36,786 --> 00:03:38,096
something amazing!
